<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">pedes subbisulci</hi></hi><note place="foot" anchored="true" n="&#x2020;&#x2020;)"><p>III. B. Mosis, Kap. XI. V. 4.</p></note>. <hi rendition="#aq">Dentes <hi rendition="#i">primores</hi> infe-<lb/>
riores</hi> 6 <hi rendition="#aq">spathiformes: superiores</hi> 2; <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">laniarii</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">distantes, superiores</hi> 3, <hi rendition="#aq">inferiores</hi> 2.</p>
<pb n="95" facs="#f0113" xml:id="pb095_0001"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Dromedarius</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">das gemeine Camel</hi>. [<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le<lb/>
dromadaire</hi></hi><note place="foot" anchored="true" n="*)"><p>Von vielen Schriftstellern und Reisenden wird hingegen das<lb/>
