fisch</hi>. (<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">tursio</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Plin</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le marsouin.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the porpoise</hi></hi>). <hi rendition="#aq">D. corpore subconiformi, dorso<lb/>
