<p rendition="#indent-1">7. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Coluber</hi></hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">couleuvre</hi></hi>). <hi rendition="#aq">Scuta abdomi-<lb/>
