ovali, cauda penicillo albo</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Leach</hi> vol</hi>. III. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 135. <hi rendition="#aq">B</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#l1em">Unter alten Baumrinden, Moos, Pilzen &#xA75B;c. Merk-<lb/>
