<p rendition="#indent-1">83. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Brachionus</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Blumenpolype</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">polype<lb/>
